WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:10.300
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:21.310
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.790
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:37.250
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.300
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.590
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.470
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.680
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:01:00.350
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:09.030
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:16.030
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.500
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:24.670
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:39.590
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.120
The moment
they met at Tokyo Tower...

00:01:42.230 --> 00:01:45.390
...the three were blown away
to another world, Cephiro.

00:01:45.500 --> 00:01:49.900
The center of this alternate world of
Cephiro, Princess Emeraude the Pillar...

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.510
...was imprisoned
by High Priest Zagato.

00:01:52.610 --> 00:01:56.370
It had become a world of terror
where monsters freely roamed.

00:01:58.780 --> 00:02:00.410
To return to Tokyo...

00:02:00.520 --> 00:02:04.280
...they must defeat Zagato
and rescue Princess Emeraude.

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:09.880
To defeat the immensely powerful
Zagato, Hikaru and company...

00:02:09.990 --> 00:02:13.980
...must revive the Rune-God
and become Magic Knights.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:19.630
Hikaru and company succeeded
in reviving Selece the Rune-God...

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:25.300
...in the underwater shrine due to their
battle with Ascot, Zagato's minion.

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:33.640
The Legend of the Rune-God-
In a World Called Cephiro

00:02:40.090 --> 00:02:42.320
I wonder where we're headed?

00:02:42.420 --> 00:02:46.190
To where Princess Emeraude
is imprisoned of course!

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:50.220
We can return to Tokyo now!

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.660
That theory does not
sound right, Ms. Umi.

00:02:53.770 --> 00:02:57.530
We must first rescue Princess
Emeraude and save Cephiro.

00:02:57.810 --> 00:03:00.430
Don't sound like a Japanese teacher.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:04.370
I wonder if we were able
to become Magic Knights...

00:03:05.550 --> 00:03:09.070
We're certainly getting closer
every day! Armor! Weapons!

00:03:09.180 --> 00:03:11.620
We even have the Rune-God now!

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.620
Y-You think so?

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:18.730
Look!

00:03:23.160 --> 00:03:26.960
It's that floating mountain we saw
when we first came to Cephiro.

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:30.440
I wonder if Princess
Emeraude is imprisoned there?

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:32.070
Mokona, hurry!

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.140
What?

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:41.010
Hey, what's going on, Mokona?

00:03:42.980 --> 00:03:43.950
Everyone!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.750
Who are you?

00:03:50.660 --> 00:03:52.960
I am High Priest Zagato.

00:03:53.660 --> 00:03:56.960
Fledgling Magic Knights,
I'm surprised you've come this far.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.330
I commend you.

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.090
High Priest Zagato?

00:04:01.870 --> 00:04:03.800
But this is the end.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.110
You saved the Magic Knights.

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:52.750
Stop this... Stop this already!

00:04:52.850 --> 00:04:55.790
I don't want anyone
else to be sacrificed!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:16.940
I wonder if it's far to the next town...

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:21.110
Oh, yeah. The whole town
seems to be feeling down...

00:05:21.420 --> 00:05:23.180
What's up with that?

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.180
Monsters attack almost every day...

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:28.980
And...

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:29.990
And?

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.680
No, it's nothing.

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:09.130
To have this many monsters
coming out... It's getting pretty wild.

00:06:21.180 --> 00:06:24.700
It wasn't like this when Princess
Emeraude was ruling the land.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:27.800
Even the weather's
acting weird thanks to Zagato.

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:35.040
Ferio...

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:39.990
Ferio, I am Emeraude.

00:06:40.460 --> 00:06:41.490
Ferio...

00:06:42.230 --> 00:06:45.960
Princess Emeraude, I will come
rescue you now! Where are you?

00:06:47.340 --> 00:06:50.430
At the lake on
the outskirts of Peerless Village...

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.440
Please save the Magic Knights!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:57.880
Please, save those girls
from another world!

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:01.400
Princess Emeraude!
Princess Emeraude!

00:07:06.750 --> 00:07:09.590
The lake on
the outskirts of Peerless Village...

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.010
Here?

00:07:33.950 --> 00:07:35.040
What's this?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.060
Hey, Fuu!

00:07:50.870 --> 00:07:52.800
Fuu, get it together!

00:07:55.100 --> 00:07:56.190
Ferio?

00:08:05.810 --> 00:08:08.040
Y'all stockpiled this many weapons...

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.910
...and nobody wants
to revolt against Lord Zagato?

00:08:13.020 --> 00:08:14.350
It's true.

00:08:14.460 --> 00:08:17.250
These weapons are
for dealing with monsters.

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:19.590
We wouldn't revolt
against Lord Zagato...

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:22.320
Those kinda excuses
won't work with me.

00:08:23.260 --> 00:08:24.230
But...

00:08:24.830 --> 00:08:28.000
However, scratch my back
and I'll scratch yours.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:29.760
H-Huh?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.370
Money! Money!

00:08:32.470 --> 00:08:34.100
If y'all pay up...

00:08:36.980 --> 00:08:38.570
Forget the money.

00:08:38.680 --> 00:08:41.910
If you kill them,
I'll keep this from Lord Zagato.

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:42.950
"Them"?

00:08:43.020 --> 00:08:45.650
Those three girls
walkin' around back there.

00:08:53.630 --> 00:08:56.460
I can't! Aren't they just children?

00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:58.660
Are you goin' against me?

00:08:59.100 --> 00:09:02.660
Even if it is to save
our village, I can't kill people!

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:04.290
You're pissin' me off.

00:09:44.250 --> 00:09:45.340
Mayor!

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:52.410
If y'all don't wanna end up
like your mayor, kill them.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.710
Got it?

00:09:56.820 --> 00:09:59.120
Am I a lucky girl or what?

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:04.190
To have those Magic Knights who
bullied Ascot walk right in front of me.

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:10.100
I'll just watch how they
fight these townspeople.

00:10:16.510 --> 00:10:21.570
Sir Mokona is not quite back
to normal yet. I wonder if it is all right.

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:23.040
Yeah...

00:10:23.620 --> 00:10:26.550
But it's just like
you guys to find a Rune-God.

00:10:27.020 --> 00:10:29.320
So how many did you find?

00:10:29.420 --> 00:10:31.860
There's more than one Rune-God?

00:10:31.960 --> 00:10:33.790
Didn't Clef tell you?

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.630
No, we didn't have time
to talk when we first met.

00:10:38.030 --> 00:10:42.660
When Cephiro faces crisis, Magic
Knights will appear from another world.

00:10:42.770 --> 00:10:46.730
Wielding swords of escudo,
and reviving the three Rune-Gods...

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.930
...they will become the Magic Knights.

00:10:50.610 --> 00:10:53.480
It's a legend in Cephiro
from way, way back.

00:10:53.580 --> 00:10:55.910
So, there are three Rune-Gods.

00:10:56.020 --> 00:10:58.210
Well, how many did you revive?

00:10:58.320 --> 00:10:59.380
Just one.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.350
I see. Just one for now.

00:11:02.460 --> 00:11:04.420
You have got to be kidding!

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.490
We have to look for two more?

00:11:06.590 --> 00:11:08.930
Zagato will kill us before that!

00:11:09.230 --> 00:11:12.760
Whoa, that's not like you.
You used to be so confident.

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:16.270
You wouldn't
understand how fearful Zagato is.

00:11:17.240 --> 00:11:20.370
Only you guys can
save Princess Emeraude!

00:11:20.470 --> 00:11:22.740
It's all right. We'll definitely...

00:11:23.510 --> 00:11:26.170
We should not go
against Zagato right now.

00:11:26.910 --> 00:11:27.880
Fuu...

00:11:27.950 --> 00:11:28.710
Fuu...

00:11:28.780 --> 00:11:31.810
We cannot defeat
Zagato as we are now.

00:11:31.920 --> 00:11:34.680
Perhaps if our armor
and weapons evolved...

00:11:35.090 --> 00:11:37.750
What are you going
to do if they don't?

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:40.290
All will be for nothing if we die!

00:11:53.110 --> 00:11:56.040
I hear you three are
friends of Mr. Ferio here...

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:07.420
This looks good!
Fuu, can you give me a sip?

00:12:07.690 --> 00:12:08.620
Don't!

00:12:08.860 --> 00:12:11.020
Why can't I have any?

00:12:11.830 --> 00:12:13.020
Because...

00:12:13.530 --> 00:12:15.620
Because it's poisoned, right?

00:12:23.740 --> 00:12:27.700
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:39.420 --> 00:12:40.550
Stop!

00:12:41.390 --> 00:12:43.480
These aren't Zagato's minions!

00:12:44.730 --> 00:12:46.690
Then what should we do?

00:12:47.090 --> 00:12:48.220
This!

00:12:53.030 --> 00:12:57.200
Listen up!
If you keep attacking, I'll kill him!

00:12:57.870 --> 00:12:58.440
Ferio!

00:12:58.440 --> 00:12:59.800
Ferio!
Ferio! Ferio!

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:03.410
Why did you attack us?

00:13:03.640 --> 00:13:05.740
It's got nothing to do with you.

00:13:05.850 --> 00:13:09.910
We're going to be killed
if we don't kill those girls over there!

00:13:10.020 --> 00:13:11.990
Who in the world would do...

00:13:12.090 --> 00:13:14.750
Caldina, one of Zagato's minions!

00:13:14.920 --> 00:13:15.850
Caldina?

00:13:16.420 --> 00:13:17.360
All right.

00:13:17.460 --> 00:13:19.260
We'll take care of her.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:21.330
There's no way you can!

00:13:21.430 --> 00:13:26.160
Oh, it's all right. These girls defeated
Zagato's minions on their way here.

00:13:26.270 --> 00:13:30.030
It's all right for you
because you can run if you fail!

00:13:30.770 --> 00:13:33.070
But we can't run away.

00:13:33.440 --> 00:13:36.880
After you run away,
all of us will be killed.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:40.780
Is there no way
that you can let us go?

00:13:40.880 --> 00:13:43.680
Not kill us and let us run away?

00:13:43.780 --> 00:13:47.380
Same difference!
If we fail, Caldina will kill us!

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:49.150
All right.

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:53.720
We won't fight Caldina.
We'll save you without fighting.

00:13:54.300 --> 00:13:55.730
That's absurd!

00:13:55.830 --> 00:13:57.890
Just do what I tell you!

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:01.400
We can choose to just
leave you and run away!

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:02.960
Ferio!

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:13.880
So what kind of
person is this Caldina?

00:14:13.980 --> 00:14:17.580
What kind of person? She was
rather persistent about money...

00:14:17.890 --> 00:14:18.980
Money?

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:23.420
Okay.

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:37.640
When the front door closes,
leave immediately from the back door.

00:14:37.740 --> 00:14:39.470
It's reckless to go by yourself!

00:14:39.470 --> 00:14:40.530
It's reckless to go by yourself!
Yeah!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:44.330
But if you go,
it really will become a battle.

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:47.210
And if by any chance
Caldina gets away...

00:14:47.310 --> 00:14:49.580
...the townsfolk would be in trouble!

00:14:51.790 --> 00:14:53.580
It's better if you're not here.

00:14:53.690 --> 00:14:55.450
Leave it to me!

00:14:56.790 --> 00:15:00.560
Why do you want to go
this far just to save us?

00:15:00.790 --> 00:15:03.560
Because
Princess Emeraude asked me to.

00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:05.660
But also...

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:08.290
...because I fell in love with you.

00:15:16.340 --> 00:15:17.640
Excuse me.

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:20.110
What are ya doin' here?

00:15:21.380 --> 00:15:24.480
I'm here to keep you
company while you wait.

00:15:24.920 --> 00:15:29.820
This entire mess started
because I brought them here...

00:15:30.320 --> 00:15:32.720
What nonsense are ya spoutin'?

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:34.190
Please.

00:15:38.970 --> 00:15:39.830
Money!

00:15:40.130 --> 00:15:41.800
Money, money, money!

00:15:43.070 --> 00:15:46.100
Are you tryin' to bribe me?
It ain't that easy.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:48.800
Bribe? Nothing of the sort!

00:15:48.910 --> 00:15:52.740
I was wondering if you wanted
to gamble while you waited...

00:15:54.580 --> 00:15:58.710
You're gonna regret it. I'm really
good with bets that involve money.

00:15:59.420 --> 00:16:00.390
Sure.

00:16:05.230 --> 00:16:07.390
That is the signal. Let us depart.

00:16:07.490 --> 00:16:09.860
Fuu, you're not worried about Ferio?

00:16:10.970 --> 00:16:15.930
I am. But we would be wasting what
Ferio has done if we do not depart.

00:16:16.040 --> 00:16:17.130
Fuu...

00:16:54.540 --> 00:16:55.670
My hand.

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.780
This hand is mine.

00:17:04.720 --> 00:17:06.980
The game has only just begun.

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:44.780
Wouldn't it be better to quit now?

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:47.360
If you want to call it quits, go ahead.

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:49.790
I was just worried about ya...

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:52.900
All right, I'll take the challenge.

00:17:54.470 --> 00:17:55.200
What?

00:17:55.200 --> 00:17:56.930
What?
No time for that.

00:17:59.670 --> 00:18:01.640
All right, here ya go.

00:18:10.250 --> 00:18:12.780
That's why I told ya to quit.

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:14.740
What?

00:18:17.190 --> 00:18:19.890
We have a problem!
Those girls ran away!

00:18:20.560 --> 00:18:21.550
What?

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:36.010
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:39.880
We've been banging on the door
to let you know all this time...

00:18:40.950 --> 00:18:41.880
You...

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:53.820
It's your fault! It's all because
you brought those girls here!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.930
W-Wait! We can talk this out!

00:19:23.190 --> 00:19:25.490
Well, I'll be goin' now!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:33.770
I'll just take the gold though.

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.170
Uh...

00:19:35.240 --> 00:19:39.000
No, it's okay. I'll let ya go this time.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:40.040
Bye.

00:19:46.910 --> 00:19:48.850
I told you it'd go well.

00:19:57.160 --> 00:19:59.250
Thank you very much.

00:20:09.070 --> 00:20:10.040
Hey...

00:20:11.840 --> 00:20:13.770
Did something good happen?

00:20:13.870 --> 00:20:15.840
Listen to me, Ascot.

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:18.200
I'll get those girls soon...

00:20:18.310 --> 00:20:22.110
...so ya can go back
to the castle with your head held high.

00:20:22.220 --> 00:20:24.210
I don't want to anymore...

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:29.150
No, no. A talented kid like you
shouldn't waste your life like this.

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:45.730
Fuu, so what should we do now?

00:20:45.840 --> 00:20:48.970
It seems that we only
have one path to take.

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.710
Zagato's minions will follow if we run.

00:20:52.780 --> 00:20:56.720
Thus, the only way is to go
against them as we grow stronger.

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:00.220
I wonder if we can
grow stronger than this...

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:06.420
It's all right! I'll make sure
we grow stronger than Zagato.

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:08.960
And let's save everyone in Cephiro!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.290
You are right! We have
to believe so and move forward!

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.830
I guess so!

00:21:23.810 --> 00:21:24.900
Ferio...

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:30.510
It worked.

00:21:31.390 --> 00:21:33.720
Ferio! You are all right!

00:21:34.290 --> 00:21:38.220
Of course. You didn't think
I'd croak that easily, did you?

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:40.950
Give me a heads-up now and then.

00:21:41.060 --> 00:21:44.290
If you call only when you
need help, it's kinda sad.

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:46.030
Later.

00:21:47.670 --> 00:21:50.100
Fuu, your face is very red.

00:21:51.070 --> 00:21:52.730
O-Oh, is it?

00:21:52.840 --> 00:21:54.600
Let us go now.

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:57.270
Hey! No! No!

00:21:57.580 --> 00:21:58.880
This way! This way!

00:21:58.880 --> 00:22:00.010
This way! This way!
Oh!

00:22:26.840 --> 00:22:31.240
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.810 --> 00:22:38.410
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.850 --> 00:22:45.420
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:49.990
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:52.300 --> 00:22:55.460
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:58.100
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:59.210 --> 00:23:03.010
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:04.040 --> 00:23:10.680
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:11.420 --> 00:23:16.690
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:17.060 --> 00:23:23.860
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:24.360 --> 00:23:29.800
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:49.760 --> 00:23:51.350
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki.

00:23:51.890 --> 00:23:54.590
During our journey,
we suddenly felt dizzy...

00:23:54.690 --> 00:23:57.560
...the ground felt wobbly,
and we couldn't keep standing!

00:23:57.730 --> 00:24:00.700
On top of that,
huge boulders started to fall down!

00:24:00.800 --> 00:24:05.500
What in the world is going on? I'm
sure someone is getting in our way.

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:07.500
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.670 --> 00:24:09.440
The Fearsome Illusionist Caldina!

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:10.240
The Fearsome Illusionist Caldina
The Fearsome Illusionist Caldina!

00:24:10.240 --> 00:24:12.250
The Fearsome Illusionist Caldina
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.250 --> 00:24:13.450
The Fearsome Illusionist Caldina

00:24:13.450 --> 00:24:21.380
Who is it today?

00:24:21.490 --> 00:24:23.350
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:23.460 --> 00:24:23.990
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:23.990 --> 00:24:26.290
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:26.290 --> 00:24:28.260
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!

00:24:28.260 --> 00:24:29.420
Look forward to the next episode!
